    "name": "Is my property suitable for a tiny home?",
    "text": "Is my property suitable for a tiny home?",
    "answerCount": 1,
    "acceptedAnswer": {
      "@type": "Answer",
      "text": "Thinking about a tiny home? That's awesome! Before you dive into designs, it's super important to figure out if your land is even up for it. It's not just about space, but also about things like zoning, local codes, and utility access. You might have a dream spot, but if the local rules say 'no tiny homes here,' then it's back to the drawing board. Zen Tiny Homes always starts with a deep dive into these specifics for San Diego and Southern California because we've worked with local agencies for over a decade. We know what to look for! Getting a professional assessment early on can save you a ton of headaches and heartbreak down the line, ensuring your tiny home vision can actually become a reality on your chosen land.",
      "author": {
        "@type": "Organization",
        "name": "Zen Tiny Homes"
      }
    }
  },
